"数据目录里的 accounts-v2.json 表明账号存放在钥匙串里，但这个条目已经不在了：可能在「钥匙串访问」里被删除了，也可能只把数据目录拷到了这台 Mac。" = "accounts-v2.json in the data folder says the accounts are in the keychain, but the keychain item is gone. It may have been deleted in Keychain Access, or only the data folder was copied to this Mac.";
"可以从 %@ 重新迁移。注意：那是迁移到钥匙串之前的数据，之后新增、修改或删除的账号都不在里面。如果你有更新的导出文件，迁移后可以再导入它。" = "You can migrate again from %@. Note that it holds the accounts as they were before they moved to the keychain: accounts added, changed or deleted since then are not in it. If you have a newer export, import it afterwards.";
"从 %@ 重新迁移" = "Migrate Again from %@";
"数据目录里没有可以重新迁移的旧文件。可以从空列表开始，再导入你导出的 .secrets 文件；也可以先退出，从备份恢复钥匙串。" = "The data folder has no older file to migrate from. You can start with an empty list and import a .secrets file you exported, or quit and restore the keychain from a backup.";
